nutrients.nitrogen,8.625,umolN/gFW,T2,,input.c:43; default.config:42,"initial condition of a state variable, not a free parameter",unit_check,"present in code, not stated in the source model -- needs a source or a T5 declaration; has its own ODE; the config entry sets t=0 only"
