nutrients.assimilation_cost_nitrogen,0.0460308,umolN/umolC6,T2,Tedone2020,"Eq 2.2.16, Appendix A","c_sn = lambda_csn * 1.724 = 0.0267 * 1.724 = 0.0460308 exactly (1.724 = 1/r_A, r_A = 0.58 umolC6/umolN, Tedone ref [111]).",unit_check+recomputed,"MISNAMED, value correct. Field holds c_sn [umolN per umolC6], NOT r_A [umolC6 per umolN]. Dimensional proof at the use site nitrogen_content() (nutrients.c:43): dn/dt [umolN gFW-1 h-1] = u_n - ph[umolC6 gFW-1 h-1]*X*(bl/B), so X must be umolN/umolC6. Substituting r_A=0.58 here is wrong by r_A^2/lambda_csn and drives MAPE 3.33 -> 99.08 (measured, trackE). LIVE and steeply asymmetric: halving costs 0.4 MAPE points, doubling costs 87. Recommend rename to nitrogen_cost_per_carbon; DO NOT change the value."
nutrients.lambda_csn,0.0267,-,T5,,Section 2.2.8 (csn = 0.053 ugSugar/ugN = 0.68 umolC6/umolN),,recomputed,"DEAD AT RUNTIME. Only consumer is assimilation_cost_nitrogen() (nutrients.c:114), which has ZERO call sites; the derived constant 0.0460308 was baked into the config by hand. Perturbation gives bit-identical output (trackE). Tedone Appendix A lists it as ""calibration"". Recommend either wiring the function at load so lambda_csn is the single source of truth, or deleting the key and recording the derivation here."
nutrients.min_nitrogen_photosynthesis,5.75,umolN/gFW,T3,Tedone2020,Eq 2.2.5,,read_paper,"n_ph = 12.7/2.21 = 5.75 umolN/gFW, Tedone Eq 2.2.4-2.2.5. Correct and correctly named. NOTE the distinct runtime slot nutrients.min_nitrogen also ships 5.75 in config but holds n_min (a different quantity, overwritten at algebraic.c:31, measured runtime 21.04 at 4 h) -- the coincidence of values invites confusion."
nutrients.min_phosphorus_photosynthesis,0.575,umolP/gFW,T2,Tedone2020,"after Eq 2.2.25 (""p_max = n_max / O"") with O = 10 from Eq 2.2.7","Derived, not stated: 0.575 = 5.75/10 using the optimal stoichiometric N:P ratio O = 10. p_min = n_min_ph / O. The value 0.575 does not appear verbatim in the source.",recomputed,"TIER CORRECTED T3->T2: the arithmetic is the source's, the number is not. LIVE and highly consequential (727-743% change in the Farquhar modes), so it belongs in the parameter table with its derivation shown."
nutrients.nutrient_conversion_parameter,0.066,-,T5,,,,read_paper,paper treats this as a fitting choice; no value stated
nutrients.assimilation_cost_phosphorus,0.00460308,umolP/umolC6,T2,Tedone2020,"c_sp = c_sn/O, Appendix A (O = 10 umolN/umolP)",c_sp = c_sn / O = 0.0460308 / 10 = 0.00460308 exactly.,unit_check+recomputed,"MISNAMED, value and dimensions BOTH correct. [umolN/umolC6]/[umolN/umolP] = umolP/umolC6; the N cancels. Verified not a defect (trackE). Recommend rename to phosphorus_cost_per_carbon."
